---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="home">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Sofie Patoor</h1>
      <div>
        <p>
          I'm a medior <strong>front-end developer</strong> with a creative background. I care about usability, accessibility and generally the craft of writing high-quality code.
        </p>
        <Button alignment={'center'}>
          Say hi!
        </Button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <h2>About me</h2>
      <div class="content">
        <p>I studied <a href="https://www.devine.be" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Digital Design &amp; Entertainment (DEVINE)</a> at Howest in Kortrijk, followed by a postgraduate degree in <a href="https://www.howest.be/nl/opleidingen/postgraduaat/applied-artificial-intelligence" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Applied Artificial Intelligence</a>. Today, I'm working as a front-end developer at <a href="https://www.dynamate.be" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dynamate</a>, where I build and maintain diverse web interfaces for a wide range of clients.</p>
        <p>Outside of coding, I tend to have <em>a lot</em> of different interests, ranging from gaming, to pilates, to creative side-quests, to finally learning how to play my guitar. When I need a break from everything digital, I enjoy <s>grandma</s> hobbies like reading, sewing and taking walks.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="current">
      <h2>Currently focused on</h2>
      <div class="content">
        <p>I want my personal website to reflect how I keep growing as a developer and put the concept of "learning in public" into practice.</p>
        <p>Right now, I'm focusing on:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>broadening my skillset as a developer by <strong>building personal projects</strong></li>
          <li>actively educating myself on <strong>digital accessibility</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  h1 {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 50vh;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;

    p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      max-width: 50ch;
    }
  }

  .hero,
  .about,
  .current {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
</style>
